flowchart TD
    accTitle: Forward+ conditional stage outline
    accDescr: This outline groups responsibilities. Actual passes and resolves depend on materials, output configuration, environment features, and compositor flags.
    Inputs[Visible geometry and render data] --> Prepare[Prepare buffers lists and shader requirements]
    Prepare --> Depth[Depth normal roughness and shadow work as required]
    Depth --> Lighting[Cluster and GI preparation]
    Lighting --> Pre[Pre opaque callbacks]
    Pre --> Opaque[Opaque drawing and motion work]
    Opaque --> Post[Post opaque callbacks]
    Post --> Sky[Sky and background]
    Sky --> Effects[Post sky and screen or specular work]
    Effects --> Alpha[Pre transparent callbacks and transparent drawing]
    Alpha --> Temporal[Post transparent and temporal work]
    Temporal --> Output[Post processing tone mapping and output]
